# proof shows the output of troff on the screen. The script gives it one page of text. At the end of the last page, proof waits for a command, and an empty command, the key Enter, stops it.
class exact
window 640x480
run {echo .ps 14; echo Plan 9 from Bell Labs; echo .sp; echo The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.} | troff | proof
quiet
snap open
exit "\n"
